{"title":"Why I Quit Being The Demon King","synopsis":"Di masa kekacauan Demon King melintasi 665 alam sebelum menyerang alam manusia\nPahlawan pemberani lah yang menghentikan perang tersebut\nBerkat pengorbanan hebat mereka umat manusia pun berhasil bertahan hidup\nNamun hal tersebut mengarah pada munculnya Demon King yang baru\nDia adalah Demiourgos Demon King yang ke666\nAku berhenti menjadi Demon King katanya sebelum meninggalkan alam iblis\nIni adalah kisah tentang Demon King yang melarikan diri dan seorang pahlawan yang menjadi bawahannya\nMengapa dirinya berhenti menjadi Demon King","alternative_title":"마왕을 그만둔 이유","author":"Lee Sang-Hyuk","artist":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"285e0ec1-3f89-4f33-bc8b-ed30d9e70de8","number":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2024-12-31","images":[]},{"id":"d51ed614-4a29-4de0-bfa7-e683dc554537","number":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2024-12-31","images":[]},{"id":"41194cf7-7e95-46b8-8efe-f04b08d7d02f","number":"35","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2024-12-31","images":[]},{"id":"16cbfb47-bbf0-4e0b-9d8f-fa745cea313b","number":"34","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2024-12-31","images":[]},{"id":"56054db5-3ef6-4ee2-b104-51ec59799002","number":"33","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2024-12-31","images":[]},{"id":"b278d98c-7f55-418f-a90e-b8e86b43619a","number":"32","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2024-12-31","images":[]},{"id":"29512a7f-7c18-488f-acb0-6c10329bab14","number":"31","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"56b5bbb2-db4b-4c75-adf3-f8baccbc2e5d","number":"30","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"4c423d60-914f-4e4f-a74f-00411f9a39f7","number":"29","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"35c23a69-34bf-4366-92a0-19503f11e08a","number":"28","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"2770d04f-ad0c-4820-bcde-b571928d8c47","number":"27","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"bfb93eac-7fd1-4c51-bea1-80532